  {
    "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60002",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "a1b2c3d4e5f60001",
    "name": "START HERE: setup in 3 steps (select this note)",
    "info": "**Setup in 3 steps** (once, about five minutes)\n\n1. **Link your WhatsApp number.** In the [Turbo Notify dashboard](https://dashboard.turbonotify.com) create an account if you have none (it is free), then open **Numbers** and connect your WhatsApp number. First time? Follow the [step by step guide](https://docs.turbonotify.com/en/guides/quickstart/).\n2. **Create an API key.** Open **API keys** and create one with the **AI agent (MCP)** template. Copy it, it is shown only once. This flow uses the scopes messages:read and messages:send.\n3. **Paste it here.** Double-click a whatsapp node of this flow, click the pencil next to **Account**, paste the key and press **Test**. It tells you whether the key works and whether your number is linked.\n\n**About this flow.** Replace +12025550123 with the number that should receive the message. Replace the inject node with your sensor (MQTT, Zigbee, GPIO or any node that emits a message when the door opens).",
    "x": 200,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
